 housing, education, safety, relationships, and adversity"}, {"id": "6e00e1f9-5b6b-4757-beec-f306e7ba5405", "type": "concept", "title": "Protective factors and resilience"}, {"id": "21179d89-112c-4105-ba84-fa662f64a68d", "type": "concept", "title": "Toxic stress and developmental opportunity"}]}, {"id": "b7a961c9-c0d3-4b2d-81d7-b22e0d283954", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Intergenerational processes", "description": "Students trace resources and risks across generations.", "children": [{"id": "f8749d26-d343-46b7-8ea6-7fd35b08aee8", "type": "concept", "title": "Wealth, neighborhood, education, caregiving, and policy"}, {"id": "782c614c-9c82-4e71-a89f-87a5c3f2dcea", "type": "concept", "title": "Trauma and discrimination"}, {"id": "533065f6-6212-4194-970f-d948b6fb35be", "type": "concept", "title": "Intergenerational mobility and reparative policy"}]}]}, {"id": "256cbd16-22d6-433f-9a6f-1de79b2f78c4", "type": "topic", "title": "Education, Health Literacy, and Information Environments", "description": "Analyze education as a determinant and design communication environments people can use.", "children": [{"id": "06e92f09-c81b-4150-82d1-a56629cee988", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Education pathways", "description": "Students connect schooling to knowledge, credentials, work, resources, and social networks.", "children": [{"id": "1830b03f-109a-43fb-8378-25a34aea2cda", "type": "concept", "title": "Early childhood and school quality"}, {"id": "e6b21d17-1eac-4ec8-9df5-80edb9d32f5a", "type": "concept", "title": "Segregation, discipline, disability access, and completion"}, {"id": "c7280164-593b-47f3-a7ad-bd9ff678b275", "type": "concept", "title": "Adult education and lifelong learning"}]}, {"id": "9fc191c0-bf81-4966-b931-9fc0a13756d8", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Health literacy", "description": "The point is system responsibility rather than labeling individuals.", "children": [{"id": "6937352f-0ee6-4298-946a-0d6d449ac5a0", "type": "concept", "title": "Personal and organiza