zards"}, {"id": "f5486185-d00a-4beb-a162-ce725aef8fcb", "type": "concept", "title": "Injury, chronic disease, mental health, and fatigue"}, {"id": "e9b8c3d4-940b-4934-943a-f62d770a3467", "type": "concept", "title": "Gig, informal, migrant, and essential work"}]}, {"id": "69116508-d2ee-4262-8a23-dcba82dc6fca", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Policy and worker power", "description": "Students examine protections and enforcement.", "children": [{"id": "9aa79422-66e1-4cd6-9a03-50d1de35c24f", "type": "concept", "title": "Occupational standards and workers' compensation"}, {"id": "b96241ed-1df8-41db-b255-f67bac833dda", "type": "concept", "title": "Paid leave, predictable scheduling, and living wage"}, {"id": "2a2b366b-ada3-4ddf-8fd1-f486e8c92bf9", "type": "concept", "title": "Unions, worker centers, and participatory safety"}]}]}, {"id": "d75f3bda-cce8-4264-ad08-c90beb48722b", "type": "topic", "title": "Housing, Neighborhoods, and Place", "description": "Understand how housing conditions, affordability, segregation, mobility, and local resources shape health.", "children": [{"id": "f0741d2c-299d-48bd-8eab-2dbdc4444a84", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Housing pathways", "description": "Students connect home to exposure, stability, stress, and care.", "children": [{"id": "d47f7636-8b66-4896-b8a6-9298fa3f459c", "type": "concept", "title": "Quality, crowding, ventilation, pests, lead, mold, and injury"}, {"id": "e7642ab8-8d18-451a-aa15-ecccb7cb1a8e", "type": "concept", "title": "Affordability, eviction, homelessness, and displacement"}, {"id": "95be505b-d656-4588-95ce-7e9cad70dcfd", "type": "concept", "title": "Accessibility, energy burden, and climate resilience"}]}, {"id": "357bd680-80ae-4574-b576-a4cd997193ee", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Neighborhood context", "description": "The point is place as both exposure and resource.", "children": [{"id": "315d6c0b-3028-41d0-a1a6-b866196de3e9", "type": "concept", "title": "Safety, green space, services, food, schools, transport, and healthcare"}, {"id": "0a685f84-a2e7-4820-8275-58618344c2d3", "type": "concept", "title": "Segregation, redlining, zoning, and investment"}, {"id": "25e7ae03-97ba-4bcf-be91-ccee7bedc523", "type": "concept", "title": "Collective efficacy, belonging, and stigma"}]}, {"id": "bc3b564c-5cc0-4907-b8c4-4527244e5837", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Place-based action", "description": "Students compare policies while watching for displacement.", "children": [{"id": "3cf0fae5-8f3c-4353-ac44-0fa79b8e87b0", "type": "concept", "title": "Housing-first, vouchers, public/social housing, and tenant protection"}, {"id": "9fd2be47-c2a8-439d-b35a-3058c3e388fe", "type": "concept", "title": "Healthy homes and code enforcement"}, {"id": "22669ef5-9614-4485-902c-711c049865bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Community development, anti-displacement, and health impact assessment"}]}]}, {"id": "8bb0ec00-0876-457e-9a7a-09b7311f2222", "type": "topic", "title": "Food, Transportation, and Material Access", "description": "Examine systems that shape whether people can obtain food, mobility, utilities, and other essentials.", "children": [{"id": "3efb06ea-b42f-4107-b32b-7452f56a7f23", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Food systems", "description": "Students move beyond individual diet choice.", "children": [{"id": "db39cf76-736c-43d3-99f5-26812c7880b0", "type": "concept", "title": "Food security, affordability, quality, culture, and time"}, {"id": "e36d693e-90e6-4ab4-b98d-a522cd75d444", "type": "concept", "title": "Retail, marketing, agriculture, labor, and school food"}, {"id": "975f5c13-6b9a-4ed9-9b02-95304c65a191", "type": "concept", "title": "Nutrition assistance and emergency food"}]}, {"id": "ad1dbc98-0f85-4533-a73c-d8a56a05dc4b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Transportation", "description": "The goal is access to work, care, education, food, and social life.", "children": [{"id": "8a702cbb-2df5-4bf1-9715-af0ffecc3e93", "type": "concept", "title": "Public transit, active transport, car dependence, and rural access"}, {"id": "c167606a-276d-4d1f-8c89-2b26f463a456", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost, time, disability accessibility, and safety"}, {"id": "38896e9e-d03f-41be-bc4c-81023a33f068", "type": "concept", "title": "Transport-related pollution and injury"}]}, {"id": "34e60c97-9aea-42b5-b170-47bc97d4564d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Material hardship", "description": "Students understand interacting resource constraints.", "children": [{"id": "f6cea362-22c0-4cfd-b0d3-c723f08e118a", "type": "concept", "title": "Utilities, childcare, clothing, medication, and hygiene"}, {"id": "33c35cef-0813-4cee-b34f-8d47b75f3040", "type": "concept", "title": "Trade-offs, scarcity, and administrative burden"}, {"id": "d5f01ed9-b4de-499b-9ddd-9980e76f009d", "type": "concept", "title": "Integrated benefits and community resource navigation"}]}]}, {"id": "1f6ba3e6-0bf5-4166-98cf-8dec11b23659", "type": "topic", "title": "Digital Access and Technology as Determinants", "description": "Treat digital connectivity, design, data systems, and algorithmic decisions as emerging social determinants.", "children": [{"id": "d775a06b-189d-451d-adb6-dc6b5b131655", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Digital divide", "description": "Students distinguish access, affordability, devices, skills, and support.", "children": [{"id": "0347e6db-d4c6-4595-8d5f-7a54e84908a2", "type": "concept", "title": "Broadband and mobile coverage"}, {"id": "d2fe45fe-c6b6-4a3f-948b-aaccf480af1d", "type": "concept", "title": "Reliable devices, private space, and accessibility"}, {"id": "40e8d879-c989-4973-a60e-b886470a9560", "type": "concept", "title": "Rural, income, age, language, and disability disparities"}]}, {"id": "b8e585f7-1bb2-40cf-905c-a6b76b18b77f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Digital health access", "description": "The point is who can use and benefit from technology.", "children": [{"id": "4ebcb4ed-fdfc-45fd-88a5-5fbb05396686", "type": "concept", "title": "Telehealth, portals, remote monitoring, and apps"}, {"id": "e208d784-cf80-4cc3-af60-d97a16bcaca9", "type": "concept", "title": "Usability, literacy, language, and workflow"}, {"id": "dd104652-4ca4-4c58-99a0-7971824b2f61", "type": "concept", "title": "Hybrid alternatives and accommodation"}]}, {"id": "4aa6ed2a-1113-428c-bfb1-005a14d26d57", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Data and algorithms", "description": "Students examine surveillance, bias, exclusion, and accountability.", "children": [{"id": "4ebed9ba-0e19-440e-8fa0-8a5c8b5ca5a0", "type": "concept", "title": "Training data and proxy discrimination"}, {"id": "4f0aff24-e320-48e3-991c-54023a35a0ab", "type": "concept", "title": "Automated eligibility/risk decisions"}, {"id": "c9149540-af4c-4835-9d2c-5dd7e2fcf846", "type": "concept", "title": "Privacy, consent, cybersecurity, and community governance"}]}]}, {"id": "9a16ea7e-2017-4496-8bcb-f97273b7c5b5", "type": "topic", "title": "Environmental and Climate Justice", "description": "Analyze unequal exposure to pollution, hazards, climate impacts, and environmental resources.", "children": [{"id": "b6d468c9-df4a-4c55-b3d2-540a08d3c95e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Environmental exposure", "description": "Students connect sources, routes, place, occupation, and susceptibility.", "children": [{"id": "415895eb-3d40-4c00-bfa3-a6681072bf3a", "type": "concept", "title": "Air, water, soil, noise, heat, chemicals, and built environment"}, {"id": "2e5c51a3-9cd8-4aa4-ba3e-87da411e3f38", "type": "concept", "title": "Cumulative impacts and multiple stressors"}, {"id": "ec52a721-d38a-40a2-94d4-7de557e03817", "type": "concept", "title": "Monitoring, zoning, enforcement, and exposure uncertainty"}]}, {"id": "225425b5-2dcc-410f-b569-47c409067362", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Climate and health", "description": "The goal is distribution of risk and capacity to adapt.", "children": [{"id": "ca9ff6dd-18c9-49c6-801d-1c994ad5f831", "type": "concept", "title": "Heat, smoke, storms, flooding, vector disease, food/water, and mental health"},